- EXPO_PUBLIC_NETLIFY_DEV_URL
  - Value: Local Netlify dev server URL (e.g., http://localhost:8888 or http://192.168.1.100:8888 for physical devices)
  - Used by: `lib/ai-jobs.ts` to call Netlify functions in development
